<section id="A6.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">F.1 </span>Event Engine Cases</h3>

<div id="A6.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A6.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We give some event cases produced by our event engine in Table <a href="#A6.T16" title="Table 16 ‣ F.1 Event Engine Cases ‣ Appendix F Cases ‣ LifeSim: Long-Horizon User Life Simulator for Personalized Assistant Evaluation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">16</span></a>.</p>
</div>
